Package: legeos-desktop
Architecture: all
Depends: legeos-session, legeos-sessiond, legeos-resourced, legeos-filed, legeos-hostd, legeos-boot-health,
 legeos-shell, legeos-portal, legeos-cli, legeos-settings, lege-comp, lege-files, cosmic-greeter, greetd,
 xdg-desktop-portal, xwayland, pipewire, pipewire-pulse, wireplumber, network-manager, bluez, upower,
 mesa-vulkan-drivers, linux-firmware, flatpak, fcitx5, orca, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: legeos-kernel
Conflicts: snapd, apport, whoopsie
Description: LegeOS desktop (metapackage)
 Installs the complete LegeOS session and default applications on an Ubuntu 26.04 base.
